  "detail_text": "Amendment 0001, 23 MAR 2026 MSRA/ABR Holders, The purpose of this solicitation amendment 0001 is to add language in Section L, L-4.0 INSPECTION OF SITE / SHIP CHECK and to respond to the questions. -------------------------------------------------------- MSRA/ABR Holders, Notice ID: N6264926RA030 Please download the attachment files listed in Section J of the solicitation from above link. Barge (CVE-202) FY26 Overhaul: NAVSUP Fleet Logistics Center Yokosuka (NAVSUP FLCY) has a new requirement in support of Barge (CVA-8) and Commander Fleet Activity Yokosuka (CFAY) Port Operations. The work is composed of one (1) Statement of Work (SOW) of various vessel repair, overhaul, preservation, and replacement work onboard the vessel. Offers will be received until 13 Apr 2026, 10:00 AM (Please submit your proposal to \" kazuo.takamura.ln@us.navy.mil \" in TO line) PERIOD OF PERFORMANCE: 15 Jun 2026 through 15 Sep 2026 PLACE OF PERFORMANCE: Yokosuka Naval Base, Yokosuka, JAPAN References in the Work Items will be provided to offerors via DoD safe (a web-based tool that provides users the capability to securely send and receive large files, including files that are too large to be transmitted via email.) Please email request for references to: Kazuo Takamura (kazuo.takamura.ln@us.navy.mil) Peter Arrieta (peterjommel.s.arrieta.ln@us.navy.mil) When submitting your proposal, you must specify any hazardous material in accordance with FAR 52.223-3 (Hazardous Material ID) and DFARS 252.223-7001. When submitting your proposal, you must specify if you anticipate sea transportation in accordance with DFARS 252.247-7022. If there is a time limit on your offer, you must specify this at submission of your proposal. If there are any amendments to this RFP, please acknowledge them when submitting your proposal in the proposal comment section. Thank you. -- Very Respectfully, Kazuo Takamura Contract Specialist Ship Repair Team/Afloat Contracts Division (C211) Contracting Department NAVSUP Fleet Logistics Center (FLC) Yokosuka DSN: 243-6187 COMM: 046-816-6187 Cell: 070-2459-0994 E-mail: Kazuo.Takamura.ln@us.navy.mil FOR OFFICIAL USE ONLY - PRIVACY SENSITIVE: Any misuse or unauthorized disclosure of this information may result in both criminal and civil penalties. CONFIDENTIALITY NOTICE: This electronic message is intended to be viewed only by the individual or entity to whom it is addressed. It may contain information that is privileged, confidential, proprietary and exempt from disclosure under applicable laws. Any dissemination, distribution or copying of this communication is strictly prohibited without prior permission. If the reader of this message is not the intended recipient, or the employee or agent responsible for delivering the message to the intended recipient, or if you have received this communication in error, please notify me immediately by return e-mail and delete the original message and any copies of it from your computer system. I AM NOT AUTHORIZED TO MAKE ANY FINANCIAL COMMITMENTS ON BEHALF OF THE U.S. GOVERNMENT. ******************************************************** We appreciate your feedback! Please complete a brief survey at: https://mynavsup.nag.navy.mil/apps/ops$protrack.customer_feedback ********************************************************",
